endobj

586 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 71 0 R/E(Race Guard Gear is a one-stop destination for motorsport riders, racing teams, and engineering enthusiasts. We combine premium riding gear and protective equipment with professional-grade custom manufacturing and technical consultation, making us the only brand that supports you both on and off the track. Whether you are suiting up for your morning ride, competing at a national-level SAE event, or building your next race machine from scratch, Race Guard Gear is your trusted partner at every stage.)/Pg 27 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

587 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 71 0 R/E(From Blue print to Build Floor. Our engineering consultation service bridges the)/Pg 27 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

588 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 71 0 R/E(gap between design and manufacturing. We work with your team to review CAD models, identify manufacturability issues, recommend material choices, and optimise parts for strength-to-weight ratio and cost efficiency. Whether you are refining a design before fabrication or troubleshooting a failed component mid-season, our consultants bring real-world motorsport manufacturing knowledge to your project. Our consultation covers design for manufacturability reviews, material and process selection guidance, tolerance stack-up and fit analysis, weld design and structural review, cost and lead time optimisation, vendor coordination and sourcing support, and mid-season component troubleshooting.)/Pg 27 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

589 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 71 0 R/E(Precision-Built. Race-Ready. Uncompromising. At Race Guard Gear, we go)/Pg 27 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

590 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 71 0 R/E(beyond gear we build the machines that push limits. Our custom motorsport parts manufacturing service is tailored for competitive racing teams, engineering students, and performance enthusiasts who demand components crafted to exact specifications. From concept to component, we handle the complete production workflow including design validation, material selection, machining, fabrication, and quality inspection. We manufacture chassis brackets, mounting plates and structural weldments, suspension components including control arms, uprights and knuckles, custom drivetrain and powertrain housings, brake system components and pedal box assemblies, steering columns, hubs and custom fasteners, aerodynamic bodywork and monocoque panels, and roll cages and safety structures. We work with chromoly steel, aluminium alloys, mild steel, titanium, and composites to deliver exactly what your build demands.)/Pg 27 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

